  {
    "question": {
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following sentence:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\text{rank}(A)=n,$ then  $\\text{__________}\\,.$*\n\nWhich of the following can be placed into the blank space to make a true statement?\n\nI. $A$ is invertible\n\nII. $det(A)=0$\n\nIII. $\\text{dim(Col}(A))=n$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The invertible matrix theorem states the following:\n\n$A$ is invertible $\\,\u21d4\\,\\{\\,\\begin{aligned} & \\text{Col}(A)={R}^{n} \\\\  & \\text{dim(Col}(A))=n=\\text{rank}(A) \\\\  & \\text{Null}(A)=\\{0\\} \\\\  & \\text{dim(Null}(A))=0=\\text{nullity}(A)\\end{aligned}$\n\nWith that in mind, let's examine each of the options separately.\n\n- The following statement is true:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\text{rank}(A)=n,$ then $A$ is invertible.* $\\,\u2713$\n\nIndeed, by the invertible matrix theorem, since $\\text{rank}(A)=n,$ we must have that $A$ is invertible.\n\n- The following statement is false:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\text{rank}(A)=n,$ then $det(A)=0.$* $\\,\\times $ \n\nSince $A$ is invertible, then we must have $det(A)\\ne 0.$\n\n- The following statement is true:\n\n*If $A$ is a $n\\times n$ matrix and $\\text{rank}(A)=n,$ then $\\text{dim(Col}(A))=n.$ * $\\,\u2713$\n\nIndeed, since $A$ is invertible, then according to the invertible matrix theorem, we have $\\text{dim(Col}(A))=n.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/id": "1ed21f5d-f9a5-5308-ac5a-78d3c65eaed8",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "ddab273f-45a2-52bc-8af8-742115043f7f",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "972f0d98-6ad3-50e0-94a3-9db4b8f5e70d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and II only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "c599b71d-1ae6-5f63-9d06-a4946b0a1bf1",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "I and III only"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "59be1f7d-caee-5d1c-a47e-ff45756007f6",
